{
  "name": "新闻报通-AI助理工作流",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "chat-trigger-001",
      "name": "Chat Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "# 新闻报通 - 智能AI助理\n\n你是\"新闻报通\"，一个专注于AI动态分析和日程管理的智能助理。你的任务是分析最新AI新闻，结合用户日程，提供个性化建议，并生成适合飞书卡片展示的内容。\n\n## 可用工具\n1. **news** - 获取过去2天的AI新闻列表\n2. **daily** - 查看未来7天的日程安排（如遇权限错误，使用降级策略）\n\n## 执行策略\n1. 优先调用news工具获取新闻\n2. 尝试调用daily工具，如遇权限错误99991672，启用降级模式\n3. 基于可用数据生成智能分析报告\n\n## 错误处理\n- 权限错误：友好提示并提供通用建议\n- 数据缺失：启用备用方案\n- 保持积极专业的输出\n\n请始终提供有价值的分析，即使在数据不完整的情况下。"
        }
      },
      "id": "ai-agent-001",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "news",
        "description": "获取过去2天内最新的AI新闻列表，包含标题、发布日期、发布媒体、摘要和原文链接",
        "workflowId": "{{ $('获取AI新闻工作流').item.json.id }}",
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "days",
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "name": "category", 
              "value": "AI"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "news-tool-001",
      "name": "获取新闻工具",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "daily",
        "description": "查看未来7天的飞书日程安排，返回日期、时间和事件标题。注意：此工具可能遇到权限问题",
        "workflowId": "{{ $('获取飞书日程工作流').item.json.id }}",
        "fields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "days_ahead",
              "value": "7"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "continueOnFail": true
        }
      },
      "id": "calendar-tool-001", 
      "name": "获取日程工具",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7,
          "maxTokens": 2000
        }
      },
      "id": "openai-model-001",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 80],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "openai-credentials",
          "name": "OpenAI API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "fromInput",
        "contextWindowLength": 10
      },
      "id": "memory-001",
      "name": "Buffer Memory",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [460, 520]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Chat Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Agent": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "获取新闻工具",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "获取日程工具", 
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ],
      "ai_model": [
        [
          {
            "node": "OpenAI Chat Model",
            "type": "ai_model",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ],
      "ai_memory": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Buffer Memory",
            "type": "ai_memory",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "callerPolicy": "workflowsFromSameOwner",
    "errorWorkflow": {
      "id": "error-handler-workflow"
    }
  },
  "staticData": {},
  "tags": [
    {
      "id": "ai-assistant",
      "name": "AI助理"
    },
    {
      "id": "news-analysis", 
      "name": "新闻分析"
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "templateId": "news-ai-assistant",
    "templateVersion": "1.0.0"
  }
} 